{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CftHBVgNb1d2JQGKhCS14","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't build the app yet.** Three stated intentions aren't enough. There are no observed failures, usage data or payment commitments, so the need is unproven.\n\n**Use the ten days to test the need:**\n\n1. **Days 1–3, observe (H1):** With the organisers' consent, review their last week of threads and note what they missed or spent time on. Hypothesis: the pain is catching up on decisions, not writing them.\n2. **Days 4–7, concierge test (H2):** Hand-write one weekly summary per organiser from their real threads. Hypothesis: they'll read and act on a summary more than they'd scan the threads.\n3. **Days 8–10, decide:** Build a thin prototype only if at least two organisers ask for the next summary unprompted. Otherwise, stop or reshape the idea.\n\n**Risks to check (H3):** Club messages contain personal data, so confirm consent and data handling before sending any thread to an AI service. Volunteer clubs may not pay, so test willingness to pay before building billing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3207,"cache_read_input_tokens":9381,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3207},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c04fd9c0-b660-4d87-a9e2-927cfa75964e","uuid":"4a7fe522-7091-4748-b1a2-39d32443ff7e","timestamp":"2026-10-10T08:58:03.586Z","request_id":"req_011CftHBVSygb3RXPfyWDXqV"}
